# Line endings are part of this repo's contract, not a preference.
#
# Two gates in the test suite compare bytes rather than meaning. test/golden-ledger.test.mjs
# asserts the fixture run reproduces test/golden/fixture-run.jsonl exactly, and
# test/readme-examples.test.mjs asserts the README's console blocks equal the CLI's real
# stdout line for line. On a clone made with core.autocrlf=true both fail, for a reason that
# has nothing to do with whatever change is under review.
#
# Checking these in is what makes a byte comparison mean the same thing on every machine.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Named explicitly for the types the byte-comparing tests read, so the intent survives
# someone relaxing the wildcard above.
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.mjs   text eol=lf
